<section class="ecom-section ecom-row ecom-core ecom-va1387459c" data-id="ecom-va1387459c" section_id="ecom-va1387459c" style="position: relative; z-index: inherit;"><div class="ecom-grid-layout core__row--columns core__row--full" data-section-id="ecom-va1387459c"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-ingrid-full-height elmspace ecom-488pueh9db2 ecom-grid-item"><div data-v-6a92e952="" class="ecom__element ecom-element element__code exporting" deep="1" ingrid="true" section_id="ecom-va1387459c"><html><head><style>
/* ---- Reset ---- */
.cs-cond-wrap *,
.cs-cond-wrap *::before,
.cs-cond-wrap *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
.cs-cond-wrap img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
.cs-cond-wrap ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
/* ---- Section ---- */
.cs-cond-wrap {
 background: #fff;
 padding: 40px 20px;
 font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
}
/* ---- Heading ---- */
.cs-cond-heading {
 font-size: 28px;
 font-weight: 700;
 color: #17222e;
 text-align: center;
 max-width: 800px;
 margin: 0 auto 30px;
 line-height: 1.3;
}
/* ---- Carousel shell ---- */
.cs-cond-carousel {
 position: relative;
 max-width: 1100px;
 margin: 0 auto;
 overflow: hidden;
}
/* ---- Track ---- */
.cs-cond-track {
 display: flex;
 transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}
/* ---- Card ---- */
.cs-cond-card {
 background: #fff;
 border: 1px solid rgba(226, 211, 216, 1);
 border-radius: 15px;
 padding: 12px;
 flex-shrink: 0;
 width: calc(33.333% - 14px);
 margin: 0 7px;
 text-align: left;
}
/* ---- Card image ---- */
.cs-cond-img {
 width: 100%;
 border-radius: 12px;
 max-height: 280px;
 object-fit: cover;
 display: block;
}
/* ---- Condition label ---- */
.cs-cond-label {
 font-size: 20px;
 font-weight: 700;
 color: #17222e;
 margin-top: 16px;
}
/* ---- Name row ---- */
.cs-cond-name-row {
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 justify-content: space-between;
 border-top: 1px solid rgba(226, 211, 216, 1);
 border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(226, 211, 216, 1);
 padding: 10px 0;
 margin: 8px 0;
}
.cs-cond-name {
 font-size: 16px;
 font-weight: 600;
 color: #17222e;
}
.cs-cond-badge {
 background: #052f55;
 color: #fff;
 font-size: 12px;
 border-radius: 50px;
 padding: 4px 10px;
 display: inline-flex;
 align-items: center;
 gap: 4px;
 white-space: nowrap;
}
.cs-cond-badge svg {
 width: 12px;
 height: 12px;
}
/* ---- Benefits list ---- */
.cs-cond-benefits {
 margin: 8px 0 0;
}
.cs-cond-benefits li {
 font-size: 14px;
 color: #17222e;
 display: flex;
 align-items: flex-start;
 gap: 8px;
 margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.cs-cond-benefits li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.cs-cond-check {
 width: 20px;
 height: 20px;
 min-width: 20px;
 background: #052f55;
 border-radius: 50%;
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 justify-content: center;
 margin-top: 1px;
}
.cs-cond-check svg {
 width: 12px;
 height: 12px;
}
/* ---- Quote ---- */
.cs-cond-quote {
 font-size: 14px;
 font-style: italic;
 color: #333;
 margin-top: 12px;
 line-height: 1.5;
}
/* ---- Arrows ---- */
.cs-cond-arrow {
 display: flex;
 justify-content: center;
 align-items: center;
 position: absolute;
 z-index: 2;
 top: 180px;
 font-size: 22px;
 font-weight: bold;
 border-radius: 50%;
 border: none;
 cursor: pointer;
 outline: none;
 height: 40px;
 width: 40px;
 background: rgba(207, 207, 207, 0.37);
 color: #000;
 transition: background 0.2s;
 line-height: 1;
}
.cs-cond-arrow:hover { background: rgba(180, 180, 180, 0.6); }
.cs-cond-prev { left: 8px; }
.cs-cond-next { right: 8px; }
/* ---- Dots ---- */
.cs-cond-dots {
 display: flex;
 justify-content: center;
 gap: 8px;
 margin-top: 20px;
}
.cs-cond-dot {
 width: 10px;
 height: 10px;
 border-radius: 50%;
 background: rgba(197, 197, 197, 1);
 border: none;
 cursor: pointer;
 padding: 0;
 transition: background 0.2s;
}
.cs-cond-dot.active { background: #052f55; }
/* ---- Mobile ---- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
 .cs-cond-wrap { padding: 30px 10px; }
 .cs-cond-heading { font-size: 25px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
 .cs-cond-carousel { padding: 0 30px; }
 .cs-cond-card { width: calc(100% - 14px); padding: 10px; }
 .cs-cond-img { max-height: 220px; }
 .cs-cond-label { font-size: 18px; margin-top: 12px; }
 .cs-cond-name { font-size: 14px; }
 .cs-cond-badge { font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 8px; }
 .cs-cond-benefits li { font-size: 13px; }
 .cs-cond-quote { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
 .cs-cond-arrow { height: 44px; width: 44px; font-size: 20px; top: 130px; }
 .cs-cond-prev { left: 0; }
 .cs-cond-next { right: 0; }
}
</style>
</head><body><div class="cs-cond-wrap">
 <h2 class="cs-cond-heading">Watch Your Skin Transform In Weeks</h2>
 <div class="cs-cond-carousel" id="cs-cond-carousel">
 
 <button class="cs-cond-arrow cs-cond-prev" id="cs-cond-prev" aria-label="Previous" style="opacity: 0.3; pointer-events: none;">‹</button>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-track" id="cs-cond-track" style="transform: translateX(0px);">
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo1.png" alt="Crepey Thighs before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Crepey Thighs</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Linda K.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Thighs look smooth — not just standing up</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>That crepey, crinkled texture finally gone</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Sitting without tugging a towel over them</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“After years of hiding my crepe paper thighs under cardigans, I started using this roller and was amazed at how much smoother they got in just a few weeks. The real test came at the pool, where I finally felt confident enough to ditch the towel.”</div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo2.png" alt="Crepey Arms before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Crepey Arms</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Denise W.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Upper arms smooth again in the mirror</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Tank tops on again — not just at home</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>No more tugging sleeves over my elbows</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“My arms went crepey out of nowhere, so I started hiding them. After about a month of rolling it on every night, the texture smoothed out. I put on a sleeveless dress without thinking — and almost cried in the mirror.”</div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo3.png" alt="Fragile, Bruise-Prone Skin before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Fragile, Bruise-Prone Skin</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Nancy M.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>That tissue-paper feeling finally gone</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>No more long sleeves in July</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Woke up without a single new bruise</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“My skin got so thin and fragile it felt like tissue paper — I was scared it’d never feel firm again. About a month rolling this on and it actually feels thicker and more cushioned, not so paper-thin. First summer in years I’m not covering up.”</div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo4.png" alt="Crepey Hands before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Crepey Hands</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Barbara S.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Hands noticeably smoother after a few weeks</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Hands don’t give away her age anymore</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Her husband noticed before she said a word</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“I used to hide my hands because they looked way older than my face. A few weeks in and my husband noticed before I said a word. Reached across the table without worrying.”</div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo5.png" alt="Crepey Butt before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Crepey Butt</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Gail H.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Butt finally looks firm and smooth again</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Body creams couldn’t do what this did</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Wore a swimsuit last weekend without hiding</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“My butt went completely flat and saggy - looked deflated. Years of body creams did nothing for it. Six weeks rolling this on and the skin actually started firming up. Wore a swimsuit at the lake without covering up.”</div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo6.png" alt="Crepey Knees &amp; Elbows before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Crepey Knees &amp; Elbows</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Carol T.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>That crepey, crinkled knee skin smoothing</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Elbows soft again — not ashy-rough</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Don’t hide behind long pants anymore</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“My knees got so crinkled I stopped wearing dresses — sitting down at brunch, I’d catch myself tugging at the hem. A few weeks rolling this on and that crepey skin actually started smoothing. Wore a dress to lunch last weekend and never thought about it once.”</div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-cond-card">
 <img class="cs-cond-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/photo7.png" alt="Weight-Loss Crepey Skin before and after">
 <div class="cs-cond-label">Weight-Loss Crepey Skin</div>
 <div class="cs-cond-name-row">
 <span class="cs-cond-name">Sharon L.</span>
 <span class="cs-cond-badge">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
 Verified
 </span>
 </div>
 <ul class="cs-cond-benefits">
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>That deflated, saggy look finally going away</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Body finally matches how the scale feels</span>
 </li>
 <li>
 <span class="cs-cond-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg></span>
 <span>Looks good undressed — not just in clothes</span>
 </li>
 </ul>
 <div class="cs-cond-quote">“Lost 60 pounds and my skin just went saggy and deflated everywhere — tried every cream, nothing. Few weeks rolling this on and it’s actually bouncing back. Losing weight was worth it again.”</div>
