 }
 .cs-step3__disclaimer {
 order: 5;
 margin-top: 14px;
 font-size: 12px;
 line-height: 1.45;
 }
}
</style>
</head><body><div class="cs-p4-wrap">
 
 <div class="cs-finally">
 <div class="cs-finally__inner">
 <div class="cs-finally__copy">
 <div class="cs-finally__header">
 <h2 class="cs-finally__title">Finally — A Formula That Works on Crepey Skin From the Inside</h2>
 <p class="cs-finally__intro"><i>Here’s what happens when you roll it on.</i></p>
 </div>
 <div class="cs-finally__body">
 <div class="cs-finally__bullet">
 <b>Menthol</b> — Opens tiny channels through your skin so the botanicals get underneath. That cool wave you feel? That’s the door opening.
 </div>
 <div class="cs-finally__bullet">
 <b>Centella Asiatica</b> — Your collagen cells aren’t dead — they went dormant when your hormones dropped. Centella wakes them up. Ten times stronger. Twenty-eight studies.
 </div>
 <div class="cs-finally__bullet">
 <b>Horse Chestnut</b> — Calms the inflammation that tears fresh collagen apart. Think of it as armor around everything Centella just built.
 </div>
 <div class="cs-finally__result">
 <b>Result:</b> That tissue-paper texture starts to smooth. Not overnight. But week by week — firmer, thicker, yours.
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="cs-finally__media">
 <video src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/c5d8f691b755484d85a0fdb1a2f8e1fc.mp4" autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" loop="" aria-hidden="true">
 </video>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-promise">
 <div class="cs-promise__shell">
 <div class="cs-promise__media">
 <img class="cs-promise__img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/ourpromise.png" alt="Our Promise — clinically tested Centella Asiatica roller">
 </div>
 <div class="cs-promise__content">
 <h2 class="cs-promise__heading">Our Promise</h2>
 <hr class="cs-promise__rule">
 <div class="cs-promise__copy-wrap">
 <p class="cs-promise__copy">Your trust means everything to us. Our roller is clinically tested with 8% pure Centella Asiatica — a gentle, botanical formula even the most sensitive skin can trust.</p>
 <p class="cs-promise__copy">We made it the way we’d want it for ourselves — real botanicals, a high standard behind every single batch. We won’t put our name on anything less.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="cs-promise__badges">
 <div class="cs-promise__badge">
 <img class="cs-promise__badge-icon" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/badge1.png" alt="Designed in USA badge">
 <div class="cs-promise__badge-label">Designed in USA</div>
 </div>
 <div class="cs-promise__badge">
 <img class="cs-promise__badge-icon" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/badge2.png" alt="Pure Botanicals badge">
 <div class="cs-promise__badge-label">Pure Botanicals</div>
 </div>
 <div class="cs-promise__badge">
 <img class="cs-promise__badge-icon" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0722/0903/9525/files/badge3.png" alt="Clinically Proven badge">
 <div class="cs-promise__badge-label">Clinically Proven</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 
 <div class="cs-step3">
 <div class="cs-step3__inner">
 <div class="cs-step3__top">
 
 <div class="cs-step3__copy">
 <h2 class="cs-step3__title">What to Expect as Collagen Support Builds Over Time</h2>
 <p class="cs-step3__intro"><i>You feel it working from the very first use — the deeper, visible change builds over time.</i></p>
 
 <div class="cs-step3__slider">
 <div class="cs-step3__rail" id="cs-step3-rail">
 <div class="cs-step3__item">
