 <div class="cs-faq" id="cs-faq-block">
 <h2 class="cs-faq__heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
 <div class="cs-faq__list" id="cs-faq-list"><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">How soon will I see results?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">You feel it on the first roll — a cool wave as it sinks in. That early softness is real, but it's mostly hydration. The firmer look takes longer: 8 to 12 weeks, as the Centella works. With consistent use, most women notice by week 3 or 4.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">Where on my body can I use it?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">This is a clinical-strength formula made for the body — your arms, legs, thighs, knees, and the backs of your hands. That's exactly where crepey, papery skin shows, and where it works best. It's made for body skin, so don't use it on your face or neck.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">How is this different from the creams and collagen I've already tried?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">Creams just sit on top — they can't get past your skin's barrier. Our roller is built different: menthol, a penetration enhancer, and deep massage work together to drive the botanicals underneath. It's one of the most effective ways a topical can actually work.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">The cooling feeling – is that normal?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">Yes — that's the point. The cool wave is the menthol opening tiny channels so the botanicals get underneath. It's a gentle cool, not a burn — we keep the menthol low on purpose.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">Is it safe, and who should not use it?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">It's formulated gentle, with the menthol dosed low — but always patch-test first. Don't use it if you're pregnant, breastfeeding, or have broken skin. On blood thinners, diabetes, or blood-pressure meds? Check with your doctor first. Keep it away from your eyes.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">How do I use it, and will it feel greasy?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">Once a day, roll it over clean, dry skin — one pass, about 30 seconds. No rubbing in, easy even on stiff hands. It dries fast: no grease, no strong menthol smell, no marks on clothes or sheets. One roller lasts weeks.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">Can I buy this on Amazon or in stores?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">No — only here, on our official site. That's the only way to get the real, full-strength formula, fresh and sealed, with your 90-day guarantee. The Amazon look-alikes aren't ours.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">How long does shipping take?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">It ships free within 24 hours, and you'll get a tracking link by email right away. Most orders arrive in about 5–7 business days.</span></div></div></div><div class="cs-faq__item"><div class="cs-faq__item-inner"><div class="cs-faq__question-row"><h3 class="cs-faq__question">What if it doesn't work for me?</h3><div><svg class="cs-faq__chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0021 8.58771C11.8705 8.58694 11.7401 8.61217 11.6182 8.66193C11.4964 8.7117 11.3856 8.78502 11.2921 8.87771L5.29214 14.8777C5.10383 15.066 4.99805 15.3214 4.99805 15.5877C4.99805 15.854 5.10383 16.1094 5.29214 16.2977C5.48044 16.486 5.73584 16.5918 6.00214 16.5918C6.26844 16.5918 6.52383 16.486 6.71214 16.2977L12.0021 10.9977L17.2921 16.2877C17.4834 16.4515 17.7295 16.5371 17.9812 16.5274C18.2329 16.5177 18.4716 16.4134 18.6497 16.2353C18.8278 16.0572 18.9321 15.8184 18.9418 15.5668C18.9516 15.3151 18.866 15.069 18.7021 14.8777L12.7021 8.87771C12.5159 8.69296 12.2645 8.58881 12.0021 8.58771Z" fill="#404040"></path></svg></div></div><div class="cs-faq__answer"><span class="cs-faq__answer-text">Then you don't pay. You get a full 90 days to try it — that's how long the real change takes. Don't love what you see? Tell us, and we'll refund every penny. No questions.</span></div></div></div></div>
 </div>
 </div>
 
